SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE

The MIT license above applies ONLY to the site code in this repository:
the HTML, CSS, JavaScript, documentation, and the generated placeholder
artwork and demo SWF files authored for this project.

IT DOES NOT APPLY TO THE HOSTED GAMES.

Every game served from this site (the files under /games/ and their
thumbnails under /thumbs/) retains its own, separate license, held by its
own author. Those licenses are recorded per-entry in games.json and are
displayed on each game's page. Adding a game to this site does not place it
under the MIT license and does not transfer any rights in it.

Do not add a game unless you have verified that its license permits you to
host and redistribute it. See README.md for the licensing checklist.

